WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.440
Want something changed?

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.980
Just tell the assistant.

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:06.820
Rhodo saves your feedback on tone, terminology,

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:11.240
and how you describe your work, and uses it to guide future drafts.

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:15.340
Your pursue and decline decisions sharpen the scoring, too.

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:19.220
So with every pursuit, the writing sounds more like your team.
